MintCurveConvexPositionFactory::positionsOf(address)
├── when owner has no current positions
│   └── it should return an empty array
├── when owner creates one position
│   └── it should return the address returned by createPosition
├── when owner creates two positions for the same market
│   ├── it should return both positions
│   └── it should preserve creation order
├── when different owners create positions
│   └── it should keep their position lists isolated
├── when positions are created
│   └── it should match the addresses emitted in PositionCreated
├── when a position transfers ownership
│   ├── it should remove the position from the previous owner
│   ├── it should add the position to the new owner
│   ├── it should derive the new owner from the calling position
│   ├── it should maintain the moved last position index after swap-and-pop
│   └── it should not duplicate a position after an ownership round trip
├── when an untracked caller reports an ownership transfer
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidPosition
└── when owner has 1,000 positions
    └── it should report gas and ABI response size for the full read
